TITLE Pyrite oxidation equilibrium, 1 kg pure water, 25C, logPO2=-0.7
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH   7.0 charge
    pe   4
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g)   -0.7  10
    Pyrite  0.0   0.1
    Goethite 0.0  0
    Gypsum  0.0   0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -si Pyrite Goethite Gypsum
END
